      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: ₹0.30 loss per share (in line with 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹364.0k (down 67% from 3Q 2025). Net loss: ₹1.91m (flat on 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 185% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 43% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
